[
    {
        "text": "\u7b2c\u56db\u5173\uff08\u540e\uff09",
        "tag": "header",
        "key": "title_test",
        "is_skippable": true,
        "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "image": "bg_indoor_n",
        "width": 1,
        "height": 1,
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkness02_intro",
        "key": "$darkness02_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5,
        "delay": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Pant* *pant*... Impressive!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The black raincoats are retreating! Run while you can!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Thanks!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't thank us. If you have the strength, you should fight alongside us!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you see him swing down from the fourth floor and graze my head like that? If I didn't freeze his weapon with the Originium FrostNova left in my backpack, I wouldn't be standing here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member A"
    },
    {
        "text": "Very impressive. They're just like the swordsmen in the gas masks back in Ursus. Even stronger, really!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You almost died, what are you so excited about? The masked swordsmen you're talking about were the Ursus Royal Guard! We only met five of them that time!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you count how many raincoats there are?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Does that mean we're even more awesome than before?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "This is not a time for jokes. Their techniques and their equipment mean they must have a city... Even the craftsmen of multiple cities supplying them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's no way we can beat them back on our own. Don't even think about trying to kill them!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I just... I just think I did pretty well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The point is this situation is way beyond what we can handle... We can't hold out for long!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037"
    },
    {
        "text": "Quiet!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member C"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016"
    },
    {
        "text": "Reporting in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sister, these are... Faust's people.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member C"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Cough* *cough*... I recognize them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_016",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "FrostNova, we received your message, and...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "avg_6_17",
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "xScale": 1.1,
        "yScale": 1.1,
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "imagetween",
        "xScaleFrom": 1.1,
        "yScaleFrom": 1.1,
        "xScaleTo": 1,
        "yScaleTo": 1,
        "duration": 15,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Why is Mephisto with you? What happened to him?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mephisto has taken some... hits to his psyche.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Him? Traumatized?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, where is Faust?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Faust stayed behind to give us, and others, a chance to escape. We left him outside the slums.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's hard to come back from that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Faust was a brave warrior.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_016",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "FrostNova, if we could, we would like to fight alongside the Yetis.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_016",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You could. We must get our remaining people out safely.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Find a sniping position and await orders. We will need your support in the coming battle. We don't know when the enemy may attack again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_016",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Understood!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1#9"
    },
    {
        "text": "Pass our location to all teams: We will guarantee a safe route for their retreat from here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Keep evacuating.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037"
    },
    {
        "text": "Understood!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member C"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Are they like the Ursus soldiers with a total disregard for collateral damage?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't think so. The Ursus were willing to use direct artillery fire on the upper city!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I knew they were brutal. But that brutal?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We saw it with our own eyes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "The raincoat people are very different.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "They see civilians as targets, since they can't tell the difference between Infected and uninfected. They don't know if maybe we're dressing up as civilians.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Ursus just didn't care, but these people don't let a single one slip through.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "There are so many fleeing, it's damn near impossible to keep order! FrostNova is in a tough spot!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sister won't let anyone die. Reunion or no.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "We came to Lungmen to fight. How did we end up saving people? It's funny.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The fighting is pretty much done. If you guys didn't show up, we'd all be dead!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Man that's crazy. You're really counting on us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Can you not talk like that...? I used to think you guys were so imposing, but now you just seem like a bunch of clowns.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You got us all wrong. We just don't talk much. Shouldn't be imposing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Anyway, aren't we supposed to be holding this place with you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're totally right! Bro, let's defend this place together!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's going on?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We... we found some locals locked up in here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "A mother and daughter. We were going to use the place as a firing position, but we don't know how to communicate with them... They seem pretty scared of us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Local language)!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lungmenite"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Local language) ...... (local language) ......!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lungmenite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1#8"
    },
    {
        "text": "She is your child, yes?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Waaahhh!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1#8"
    },
    {
        "text": "Such a healthy one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't be afraid. Don't cry. Your mama is right here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mama is here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Waaahhh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mm... Um... Mm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hehe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, the child is smiling...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Get her out of here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "...... (Local language)?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lungmenite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You *cough* escort her. See her to safety.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "They're uninfected. There are so many of our people who need evacuating. We don't have time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Right. Who cares whether it's the Infected or the uninfected now? Understood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037"
    },
    {
        "text": "Erm, uh, ma'am, um... Komm zis way?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Neidei, neidei... hou.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lungmenite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "FrostNova, Sister, wait for us to come back. Don't try to hold on your own.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Have some faith in your big sister.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1#9"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hurry! They're coming!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "They are deploying some units wearing other uniforms... They might be Lungmen's L. G. D.!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Cough* *cough* ... *hack*.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "image": "bg_indoor_f",
        "width": 1,
        "height": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037"
    },
    {
        "text": "The temperature is as low as it will go!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The uniformed ones are no match for us, but watch out for the raincoats!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Where's Nesti? We need more firepower. We need suppressing fire!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member C"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "He says okay!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member A"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't think Sister's body can take much more. She can't keep the temperature down!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037"
    },
    {
        "text": "We can't break the pavement?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No way! If we do that, how will our people and the locals get to the exit?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member C"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We're sure this is the only way out?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. The other ones have all been destroyed. All that's left is the one we dug.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member C"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037"
    },
    {
        "text": "How much time do we have? Or how much time does Sister have?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member A"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why must it come down to tormenting her so?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member A"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're almost done!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll go get Sister!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member C"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
