    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Sister, we've just about got this group evacuated!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member C"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "And the fighting... how goes?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We've got the L. G. D. completely suppressed. The terrain favors us, and they can't make use of their superior numbers.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member C"
    },
    {
        "text": "But...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member C"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You have nothing to hide.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Lungmen's raincoat brigade doesn't care about the terrain, or the people. They... they're going to level everything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member C"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're purging the slums",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member C"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "And those uninfected Lungmenites we saw...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm afraid that was their doing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member C"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Sister, stop your Arts! We can handle these ones ourselves. Just rest for a bit!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member C"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "*Cough* *cough*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Sister!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member C"
    },
